00:07:24,444 --> 00:07:30,444
The Descent is a adventure, horror film directed by Neil Marshall.

3
00:11:06,666 --> 00:11:12,666
After a personal tragedy, Sarah joins her friends on a
caving expedition in the Appalachian Mountains.

4
00:14:48,888 --> 00:14:54,888
But when a rockfall traps them deep underground,
their adventure turns into a nightmare.

5
00:18:31,111 --> 00:18:37,111
As they search for a way out, the group discovers they are not
alone—lurking in the darkness are savage, cave-dwelling creatures.

6
00:22:13,333 --> 00:22:19,333
With rising tension and dwindling trust, the women must fight to
survive against both the predators and each other.

7
